rding either, so never suggest the app as a way to use the user's own text. If the user has their own use case or sample messages, explain that Quo writes these for them. What the user controls is the business details and messageTypes: keep those accurate, and to change what Quo writes, correct them with update-a2p-registration (include messageTypes, plus one of the business fields that trigger it, such as name resent with its current value), and Quo writes the messaging again. Fails with a conflict if the workspace already has a registration. Requires a workspace owner or admin and an active paid subscription.

