// Identifies this one phone call so it is never placed twice. Make one up the first time you try to place the call: a short description plus the number being called and a few random characters (e.g. 'confirm-friday-appt-15555555555-x7k2'). Then send exactly the same key every time you call this tool for that same call: after the userConfirmed prompt, after an error or timeout, or whenever you are unsure whether the call went through. Use a new key only when the user wants a different call or another call to the same number.
idempotencyKey: string, // minLength: 8, maxLength: 128
}): Promise<unknown>;
